        "official_en_sha256": "a72c2ae2190dbe2bce44bd1f7586d456577d376e1ef9865c7dbaccb86c30a762"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それで俺を本気にしようと、世界を壊すなんて\r\nすぐバレる嘘をついたんだな。",
        "official_en": "And that’s why you lied about ruining our world... I’ll say it again: I saw right through it, Gilgamesh.",
        "real_en": "So you told that obvious lie about destroying the world to make me fight you seriously."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
