        "official_en_sha256": "9b00a4bfafc328b8045e1730113f985574e71f526bd44f1f10d073451254305b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だから、あの戦いに似た場所で、真剣に戦えば\r\nオレの魂に宿る想いが、世界をつないで……",
        "official_en": "So I thought to myself, “Listen, Gilgamesh. Fight in earnest at that place that reminds you of those memories.”",
        "real_en": "So I thought that if I fought with all my strength in a place like the one where that battle happened, the feelings in my soul might connect the worlds..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
