      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "よし！　次に会う時まで、こいつを貸してやる。\r\nオレだと思って、大事に使えよ！",
        "official_en": "You know what? Here, take this thing hostage. Be prepared for me to “rescue” it from your chest when we meet again. Treat it well!",
        "real_en": "All right! Until we meet again, I'll lend you this. Take good care of it, and think of it as me!"
      },
